{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國今年夏糧收購已超過9,000萬噸，南方早秈稻陸續進入市場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8495780_中國夏糧購九千萬噸 托市穩農心 - 截图6\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/972bd9114b2c46319341a42e6cf92332/snapshots/c82e736b807a44eeaa31baad86cf5bcc-00006.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 8495780_中國夏糧購九千萬噸 托市穩農心 的第6张截图\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">為保障農民收入，國有背景的最低收購價政策自8月起有序啟動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8495780_中國夏糧購九千萬噸 托市穩農心 - 截图7\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/972bd9114b2c46319341a42e6cf92332/snapshots/c82e736b807a44eeaa31baad86cf5bcc-00007.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 8495780_中國夏糧購九千萬噸 托市穩農心 的第7张截图\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">各地主管部門正確保新糧應收盡收，保障糧食安全，維護農民收益。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T00:19:06.010255+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}